      "title": "Adding User Login",
      "sourceHash": "d00721e451863a4d90ce58ba9c7a9fe9da3e8baabe5a7c89f7b0df3a4183e865",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.19,
          "end": 4.96,
          "en": "Now when it comes to logging in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.96,
          "end": 6.99,
          "en": "that actually all already works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.99,
          "end": 9.51,
          "en": "Because the action that we created here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.51,
          "end": 12.84,
          "en": "for this authentication page does send a request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.84,
          "end": 15.39,
          "en": "based on the mode we selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.39,
          "end": 17.493,
          "en": "It depends on the data that's needed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.447,
          "end": 21.45,
          "en": "and the login route therefore is triggered correctly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.45,
          "end": 23.79,
          "en": "the backend login route, I mean.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.79,
          "end": 25.62,
          "en": "Therefore, we should already be able to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.62,
          "end": 27.753,
          "en": "enter our valid credentials here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.755,
          "end": 30.237,
          "en": "So the email and password,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.237,
          "end": 34.2,
          "en": "which we used before for creating a user, and submit this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.2,
          "end": 35.49,
          "en": "And indeed it works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.49,
          "end": 38.013,
          "en": "we're redirected and we are logged in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.09,
          "end": 42.03,
          "en": "Now, if we use an invalid password,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.03,
          "end": 43.74,
          "en": "then we get an error here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.74,
          "end": 47.19,
          "en": "Or if I use an email address that doesn't exist.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.19,
          "end": 49.86,
          "en": "But I can log in with valid credentials,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.86,
          "end": 53.79,
          "en": "and therefore we already got that login feature implemented.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.79,
          "end": 55.71,
          "en": "And therefore now as a next step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.71,
          "end": 58.14,
          "en": "we can finally focus on that token",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.14,
          "end": 60.829,
          "en": "which we're getting back from the backend,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.829,
          "end": 64.44,
          "en": "and which we must attach to requests to protected resources.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.44,
          "end": 66.93,
          "en": "Because at the moment, you'll notice that if I, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.93,
          "end": 69.123,
          "en": "try to delete an event here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 70.83,
          "end": 74.7,
          "en": "the app crashes here due to an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.7,
          "end": 77.55,
          "en": "And it crashes here because we're not authorized",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.55,
          "end": 79.5,
          "en": "to delete an event yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 79.5,
          "end": 82.02,
          "en": "because we haven't added that token",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.02,
          "end": 84.63,
          "en": "to that outgoing request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.63,
          "end": 87.12,
          "en": "That's therefore what I wanna do as a next step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 87.12,
          "end": 90.03,
          "en": "Though, before I do that, I will actually make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 90.03,
          "end": 94.17,
          "en": "that we do show an error page here if things go wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.17,
          "end": 98.52000000000001,
          "en": "Now, we do have an error page here in theory,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.52000000000001,
          "end": 101.49000000000001,
          "en": "but that's not showing up, because on my error page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.49000000000001,
          "end": 103.53,
          "en": "I am including that main navigation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 103.53,
          "end": 106.62,
          "en": "which uses a feature that can't be used there like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.62,
          "end": 109.8,
          "en": "If I remove that, we do see that error page again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 109.8,
          "end": 113.43299999999999,
          "en": "So we must attach that token to the outgoing request.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
